From 5fd16381ceaf64a77fb21a6a6a540e76554787d6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: EscapeA <escapea@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 07:56:54 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(chat): hide chat message identities behind session
 identity toggle

Extend display.show_session_identity (settings.display.showSessionIdentity)
to also control the chat view: when off, hide the assistant message-side
profile/agent avatar, the assistant author row, and the user author row
(profile name + avatar). Sidebar session list behavior is unchanged.
Default remains on. Hint text updated in all locales.
